+    /// servidor/estudios/conversor-s8/lo-que-falta/5-items-y-drops-hechos.md.
+    /// Not added on purpose: 12/145 Mithril, 12/147 Elixir and the two "Bunch" items 12/148 and
+    /// 12/149, because they are only reachable through the 5-to-1 stacking rule of
